["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Side Project to $9M Raised, No Co-Founder | Yahia Bakour, Context.dev NRR (Net Revenue Retention) design partner agency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-solofounders-融到900万美元后他说-拿了风投的钱-更应该一个人创业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba8972d929c3a758-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">57:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>融到900万美元后他说：拿了风投的钱，更应该一个人创业</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把融资比作婚姻：一旦签了就是十年，而正因为用的是别人的钱，独自决策反而让该转向、该拒绝的艰难时刻更容易拍板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">独立创始人</span><span class=\"tag\">融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Does It All Mean, Though? trial by combat weregild\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-britishhist-罗兰之歌-审判戏其实是给封建公爵们的一记警告/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>《罗兰之歌》审判戏其实是给封建公爵们的一记警告</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加纳隆被马拉肢解、全家三十名男丁被灭门，这个结局是在为「国王拥有绝对暴力垄断权」的集权叙事背书，而非单纯的复仇故事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪史</span><span class=\"tag\">封建制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Shopping in an Era of Surveillance Capitalism surveillance pricing drip pricing dark patterns loyalty penalty right to repair\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-mastersinbiz-忠诚计划的陷阱-你越常买-优惠反而越少/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cce6bb022eede7c0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>忠诚计划的陷阱：你越常买，优惠反而越少</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一旦算法确认你是「稳定客户」，公司不再需要给你折扣，星巴克和麦当劳的用户数据报告都证明了这一点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">监控定价</span><span class=\"tag\">消费者权益</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Notion’s Founder on the One Thing Your AI Is Missing vibe coding headless product\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-aiandi-notion创始人-ai能给你代码-但不该替你保管-理解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9bccab920fb419de-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">33:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>Notion创始人：AI能给你代码，但不该替你保管「理解」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vibe coding让人人都能做软件，但Ivan Zhao认为真正耐久的不是UI和过程代码，而是数据和上下文——谁掌握这个，谁才是AI时代的赢家。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Notion</span><span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Software factories and code reviews with Harjot Gill hill climbing software factory polyphasic sleep\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-pragmatic-创始人边开特斯拉fsd边指挥ai编码-月提交5000次/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1ee23f2f57f8e42d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>创始人边开特斯拉FSD边指挥AI编码，月提交5000次</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">CodeRabbit创始人认为人工代码评审已死，软件工程的瓶颈从人才转向token消耗，小团队靠驱动AI代理也能做到Facebook级别的发布规模，但代价是巨额算力和CPU账单。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI编程</span><span class=\"tag\">软件工厂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Do Pigeons Navigate with Their Livers? A New Study Sparks Debate magnetoreception radical pair hypothesis cryptochrome macrophage superparamagnetism authorization vs appropriations\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-fromfirstprinc-鸽子用肝脏感知地球磁场-物理学家联手算出根本不可能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dabc3192df79062a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>鸽子用肝脏感知地球磁场？物理学家联手算出根本不可能</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这篇登上Science封面的论文称鸽子靠肝脏巨噬细胞在阴天导航，三位磁感应领域的元老级学者联手计算后反驳：该机制在体温下热噪声比磁场信号大30倍，物理上站不住脚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">磁感应</span><span class=\"tag\">鸽子导航</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"First observation of a giant star swallowing its neighbour common envelope phase/evolution dynamical friction quantum entanglement Bell test no-cloning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-naturepod-恒星直接吞噬伴星首次被观测到-结局是合并爆炸而非幸存双星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">24:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>恒星直接吞噬伴星首次被观测到，结局是合并爆炸而非幸存双星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">天文学家在仙女座星系捕捉到一颗巨星七年缓慢变亮后突然爆发到百万倍太阳亮度，证据显示伴星没能逃脱，而是被拖入核心合并，而非常见理论里设想的「甩掉外壳、双星幸存」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">天体物理</span><span class=\"tag\">双星演化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Build The Future: Eric Glyman, Co-CEO of Ramp Jevons paradox Coase&#x27;s theorem AI harness MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-ycsp-ramp-内部不招人一个季度-只为逼团队学会用-ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c6301d17041505af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">54:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>Ramp 内部不招人一个季度，只为逼团队学会用 AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ramp 发现工程师用 AI 后生产力达到 100 倍，但销售、设计跟不上就会拖垮组织，于是干脆暂停整季招聘，强迫所有人把 AI 变成核心能力而非附加技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Louise Michel, Anarchist Paris Commune Kanak\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-stuffmissed-审判席上她不求宽恕-只要求与同志们一起受罚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>审判席上她不求宽恕，只要求与同志们一起受罚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法国政府以为流放和监禁能驯服她，结果路易丝·米歇尔在法庭上拒绝自辩，公开承认参与巴黎公社的一切行动并要求判处死刑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人物传记</span><span class=\"tag\">法国历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Missing Layer for Personal AI | First Person Labs’ Ken Liu confidential inference zero data retention Second Local reflective productivity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-a16z-ai给你建一个-第二人格-连创始人都看不到你的那份/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">33:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>AI给你建一个「第二人格」，连创始人都看不到你的那份</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">First Person Labs把数据和推理拆开：本地或机密计算里跑模型，公司自己也证明不了能看到你的内容，信任靠硬件而不是承诺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人AI</span><span class=\"tag\">机密计算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How GTA VI Became the Most Expensive Video Game Ever Made performance capture microtransactions stranger encounters\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-oddlots-gta6烧掉十几亿美元-但制作人说这是个例-不是行业范本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">50:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>GTA6烧掉十几亿美元，但制作人说这是个例，不是行业范本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rockstar靠GTA系列的确定性才敢把预算花到十几亿美元，而行业其他公司正因为销量没跟上预算增长而被迫削减开支，GTA6无法被复制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">游戏行业</span><span class=\"tag\">GTA6</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vol.292｜施展×刘擎：从阴山互市到上海口岸，碰撞中的秩序生成 impersonal plus game\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-cn27f438-明朝打不过蒙古就开放互市-战争立刻消失了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">35:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">东腔西调</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>明朝打不过蒙古就开放互市，战争立刻消失了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">嘉靖朝南倭北虏打得筋疲力尽，换了皇帝开放互市和海禁，战争就没了——贸易不是零和博弈，规则常常是在冲突耗尽双方之后、在交往界面上长出来的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">制度史</span><span class=\"tag\">上海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Indigenous Entomology (BUGS &amp; TRADITIONAL ECOLOGICAL KNOWLEDGE) with Cheyenne Reuben-Thomas cultural fire Three Sisters traditional ecological knowledge (TEK)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-ologies-入侵物种也在-干自己的活-原住民生态知识不用好坏二分法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>入侵物种也在&quot;干自己的活&quot;:原住民生态知识不用好坏二分法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">欧洲蜜蜂、亚洲瓢虫这类常被叫作「入侵种」的生物，在原住民生态知识里被看作在履行各自的生态职责，而不是非黑即白的敌人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">昆虫学</span><span class=\"tag\">原住民知识</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"BI 250 Nima Dehghani: How Brains Compute computational closure functor divisive normalization winner-take-all wave walker / pilot wave\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-braininspired-ai-的-智能体-说法是误称-自主性要靠计算闭合-不是算力堆出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9d77f3058f9aa91-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Brain Inspired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>AI 的「智能体」说法是误称：自主性要靠计算闭合，不是算力堆出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">判断一个系统有没有自主性，不是看它能不能做图灵完备的运算，而是看它的内部回路能不能自己闭合——这正是现在所谓AI agent名不副实的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span><span class=\"tag\">计算理论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"157. 复盘Personal Agent集体诞生背后：和蔡伟聊AI产品史、需求真伪、入口与未来想象 harness MCP A2A\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-zhangxiaojun-个人助理的竞争短期看模型-中长期拼的是供给和安全信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c56751483666a88-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>个人助理的竞争短期看模型，中长期拼的是供给和安全信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蔡伟判断模型能力早晚会进入稳态、各家大差不差，届时真正拉开差距的是谁手握更多线下供给、谁的安全合规做得足够深。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Personal Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">AI产品策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"对话 Google Cloud FDE 负责人王书元：FDE落到企业上，第一步是造“样板间” FDE brain in a vat FDE BP nano banana self-distillation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-guijilichang-别急着买工具-企业ai落地的第一步是造一个能跑通的样板间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38d8d27c2f34d3c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅基立场</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>别急着买工具，企业AI落地的第一步是造一个能跑通的样板间</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王书元说，AI不像数据库这类旧技术升级——每个人对AI都有自己的理解，靠集思广益很难推进，企业应该先在一个部门做出能闭环的样板，再靠示范效应说服全公司跟进。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">FDE</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI落地</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Are We Addicted to Control? with Dr Anna Lembke infinite flexibility mental map / mental model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-iq2-你的焦虑不是缺乏控制-而是控制过了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e254f7f220660b07-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">40:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>你的焦虑不是缺乏控制，而是控制过了头</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Lembke 认为现代人的恐惧、孤独和羞耻感根源于「无限可塑性」的幻觉——以为自己能掌控一切，结果一旦失控就只剩自责，而真正的解药是向自己之外的更高力量交出意志。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理健康</span><span class=\"tag\">自恋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"414. Lawrence of Arabia: Palestine, Iraq, &amp; The Motorcycle Crash (Part 4)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-18-empirehist-劳伦斯空手赴巴黎和会-犹太代表团却带着水权地图谈妥一切/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">57:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>劳伦斯空手赴巴黎和会，犹太代表团却带着水权地图谈妥一切</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1919年巴黎和会上，阿拉伯代表团迟到、无文件、无策略，而犹太复国主义代表团已游说六周并备好详细的水权与移民方案，这场较量从一开始就不对等。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东史</span><span class=\"tag\">巴以冲突</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Databricks CEO: AGI Is Already Here, Why Companies Are Behind, and the Superintelligence Debate ontology RSI (recursive self-improvement) paperclip maximizer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-allin-他说agi去年就实现了-企业落后是因为连会都不敢录/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/74597b3fa701beb0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>他说AGI去年就实现了，企业落后是因为连会都不敢录</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ali Ghodsi认为用他们当年AMP实验室的定义，AGI去年就已达成，但企业卡在第一步——银行CEO直接拒绝让AI记录会议，没有上下文，再强的模型也帮不上忙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业AI落地</span><span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Water in the Mantle with Rita Parai mantle plume primordial isotope radiogenic isotope late veneer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-geologybites-地幔柱的源头一开始是干的-水是后来被俯冲带进去的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9574accafd612c22-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">29:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Geology Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>地幔柱的源头一开始是干的，水是后来被俯冲带进去的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">惰性气体同位素模型显示，地幔柱源头在地球吸积末期的水分比上地幔少4到250倍，但如今却靠俯冲带水反超上地幔达20倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地幔</span><span class=\"tag\">地幔柱</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can AI Learn to Improve Itself? | Recursive Self-Improvement RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) perplexity chain of thought monitorability confessions research\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-a16z-ai研究员已经存在-但还没学会-品味/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">17:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>AI研究员已经存在，但还没学会「品味」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI和Thinking Machines的两位核心研究者认为，AI已能自主跑实验、加速研究，但判断哪个想法值得追的「品味」，仍然主要来自人类研究者的经验而非模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RSI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to compress text to 1 bit per character | Compression is Intelligence Part 3 arithmetic coding Hutter Prize cross-entropy asymmetric numeral system\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-karpathy-把文本压到每字符不到1比特-算术编码揭示压缩即预测/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/574b8c7bf81d687f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">37:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>把文本压到每字符不到1比特：算术编码揭示压缩即预测</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">任何文本预测器都能通过算术编码几乎无损地变成压缩器，反过来压缩器也能还原出预测分布——压缩率本质上取决于语言模型预测的好坏。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息论</span><span class=\"tag\">语言模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"我给机械臂装了个本地大模型：几行代码就能干的活，为什么要用AI？ NPU XDNA2 BFP16/BlockFP16 prefill/decode full fusion Quark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-laoshi-给机械臂装大模型不为更快更准-是为听懂模糊指令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06b649dce3e37e38-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">15:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>给机械臂装大模型不为更快更准，是为听懂模糊指令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">传统程序几行代码就能让机械臂转20度，但做不到理解「跟大家打个招呼」这种模糊意图——这才是用AI的真正理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">物理AI</span><span class=\"tag\">端侧推理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Brad Gerstner &amp; Geoffrey Canada - Raising the Floor for Every American Child - [Invest Like the Best, EP.501] 530A account / Trump account cold start problem CalKids\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-ilt-美国已为7000万儿童自动开户-账户永久不可被国会撤销/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cb9087b8e12d941-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>美国已为7000万儿童自动开户，账户永久不可被国会撤销</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">账户创建条款写进法律永久生效，像社保一样不会因换届被废除；真正每届国会要重新拨款的只是出生时那1000美元的联邦种子资金，到2029年前已有资金保障。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">慈善</span>\n</div></div></a>"]